name: Negative Tag — free negative edition
author: corpus
description: >-
  Negative Tag makes the next base-edition Joker in a shop become Negative and free.
  Ante 2+ skip reward: pair with Uncommon/Rare Tag to get a free Negative slot-expanding
  joker, or with Joker Stencil.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - tag: NegativeTag
    antes: [2, 3]
    sources:
      tags: true
should:
  - joker: JokerStencil
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Blueprint
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - spectralCard: Ectoplasm
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
